                    "Data Anonymization",
                    "Audit Trail and Reporting",],
            },

            {
                title: "Omnichannel Experience",
                description:
                    "Deliver a consistent chatbot experience across web, mobile, messaging apps, voice, and video channels for better user engagement.",
                points: [
                    "Unified user experience across channels",
                    "Web, mobile, and messaging app integration",
                    "Voice and video channel support",
